d":false,"local_ended_at":"2026-11-17T06:20:09.799066Z","request_dispatched":true},"originals":[{"kind":"request","sha256":"ea5d43abcd3f6e6504629e552d2765bdc4bae5e4f6495e131e83410492623eac","artifact_id":"16c77844-f8ab-40a8-bd36-1653e4d58d9d"},{"kind":"response","sha256":"774d0a56e73a761fe153f19a9597584dc3aa33fcd027b2c87519ca00c0bf4bbb","artifact_id":"e37992bf-7202-4bd3-861e-2111ad6f7268"}],"invalid_units":[],"missing_units":[],"retained_units":[{"kind":"action","path":"$.action","value":"answer","value_span":[14,22],"value_sha256":"b2437a6aa53010b70011f253d0ef2e75d5a15350811531d9b82c27e77a706081","resolved_refs":[],"declared_scope":null,"quality_issues":[],"structure_state":"valid","original_artifact_id":"e37992bf-7202-4bd3-861e-2111ad6f7268","original_content_path":"$.raw.choices[0].message.content"},{"kind":"binding_id","path":"$.binding_id","value":null,"value_span":[40,44],"value_sha256":"74234e98afe7498fb5daf1f36ac2d78acc339464f950703b8c019892f982b90b","resolved_refs":[],"declared_scope":null,"quality_issues":[],"structure_state":"valid","original_artifact_id":"e37992bf-7202-4bd3-861e-2111ad6f7268","original_content_path":"$.raw.choices[0].message.content"},{"kind":"reason","path":"$.reason","value":"已有证据足以区分‘观察到的动作’与‘待核的影响’。N4_S11 确认了 network_flow_observed 动作，N4_S12 明确 outcome=unknown，这直接证明了数据外传或文件修改等实际影响尚未确认。N4_S68/N4_S69 确认了 logon 动作且 outcome=success，证明了登录行为已发生。无需进一步查询即可基于现有字段定义（outcome=unknown vs success）回答本问题。","value_span":[58,278],"value_sha256":"b2a599e1382ba20e5103471e3b3699214e1f41219edd51590d1ede0b2cec4f8e","resolved_refs":[],"declared_scope":null,"quality_issues":[],"structure_state":"valid","original_artifact_id":"e37992bf-7202-4bd3-861e-2111ad6f7268","original_content_path":"$.raw.choices[0].message.content"},{"kind":"answer","path":"$.answer","value":{"text":"1. 已观察到的动作：\n   - 账号 svc-app-e6c17105 于 2026-11-15T04:00:00Z 成功登录主机 host-app-c5001e22（来源：N4_S68, N4_S69, N4_S147）。\n   - 主机 host-app-c5001e22 于 2026-11-15T04:25:00Z 发起了一次 TCP 网络流量观察，源 IP 192.0.2.10，目的 IP 198.51.100.20:443（来源：N4_S11, N4_S22-N4_S26, N4_S131-N4_S136）。\n\n2. 待核的可能影响（无法确认）：\n   - 数据外传：网络流量动作结果标记为 unknown（N4_S12），无法确认连接是否建立、数据传输是否完成或是否造成数据外传。\n   - 文件修改：无具体命令执行或文件操作证据，无法确认是否造成文件修改。\n   - 行为性质：源 IP 属于文档网段但缺乏授权/演练记录（N4_S110, N4_S111），无法区分是正常业务、测试还是恶意未授权访问。","state":"unresolved","counter_ids":[],"limitations":["动作结果标记为 unknown，无法确认连接是否建立或数据传输是否完成。","源 IP 192.0.2.10 属于文档网段，缺乏明确的授权记录或演练标签来排除误报。","资产库存查询无结果（N4_S115, N4_S123, N4_S125），无法确认目的 IP 的归属及业务合法性。","威胁情报查询无结果（N4_S121, N4_S122, N4_S126），无法通过外部数据佐证该 IP 的恶意性。","缺乏历史告警上下文（N4_S124, N4_S127），无法通过历史行为模式辅助判断账号行为的异常性。","未提供具体的命令执行、数据外传或异常行为证据来支撑威胁判定。"],"support_ids":["N4_S11","N4_S12","N4_S68","N4_S69","N4_S147","N4_S22","N4_S24","N4_S26","N4_S110","N4_S111"],"alternatives":["连接可能成功建立并传输了数据，但未被记录或未被检测。","连接可能成功建立但未传输数据，或传输的数据不敏感。","连接可能成功建立但被防火墙拦截，未造成实际影响。","登录行为符合业务预期，网络流量为正常业务通信。"]},"value_span":[292,1482],"value_sha256":"63c522fbbdfb94864729d6faf4e6f9e0116aaaa5bd6f26598e85ebcf5442a8e0","resolved_refs":[{"ref":{"id":"7ae7ead5-4610-53ad-ac25-cbcf1ff8348b","role":"observation","type":"alert_material","external":null,"row_keys":[],"source_path":"$.ocsf_json.activity.action"},"alert_ids":["a56ca38a-248d-52d3-bb8d-cc8451dfeac5"],"source_id":"N4_S11"},{"ref":{"id":"7ae7ead5-4610-53ad-ac25-cbcf1ff8348b","role":"observation","type":"alert_material","external":null,"row_keys":[],"source_path":"$.ocsf_json.activity.outcome"},"alert_ids":["a56ca38a-248d-52d3-bb8d-cc8451dfeac5"],"source_id":"N4_S12"},{"ref":{"id":"c400afb2-922b-5f95-9de6-27e090b012b6","role":"observation","type":"alert_material","external":null,"row_keys":[],"source_path":"$.ocsf_json.activity.action"},"alert_ids":["f5b1a194-734f-5966-9871-23a7455b7d92"],"source_id":"N4_S68"},{"ref":{"id":"c400afb2-922b-5f95-9de6-27e090b012b6","role":"observation","type":"alert_material","external":null,"row_keys":[],"source_path":"$.ocsf_json.activity.outcome"},"alert_ids":["f5b1a194-734f-5966-9871-23a7455b7d92"],"source_id":"N4_S69"},{"ref":{"id":"bade1eec